# Firebase App Check — see the rollout notes in src/firebase.js BEFORE enabling.
#
# ⚠️ Wildly shares the `tarongatracka` Firebase project with Taronga Tracka, so App Check
#    enforcement is project-wide. Both apps must ship tokens before enforcement is switched on,
#    or whichever app is missing goes down instantly.
#
# ⚠️ The reCAPTCHA v3 site key is DOMAIN-SCOPED. It must list BOTH wildlybytaronga.com.au and
#    tarongatracka.com.au (plus localhost for dev).
#
# ⚠️ Must also be set in the GitHub Actions build env, or the live site ships without it.
# From Firebase Console → App Check → Fraud Defense (reCAPTCHA Enterprise). The SAME key as
# Tracka uses — both apps share one Firebase app registration.
# VITE_APPCHECK_SITE_KEY=

# Local dev only. Prints a debug token to register under App Check → Manage debug tokens.
# VITE_APPCHECK_DEBUG=false
